{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38881","headline":"乱後出山逢高员外 · 杜荀鹤","name":"乱後出山逢高员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从乱後别京关，一入烟萝十五年。\n重出故山生白发，却装新卷谒清贤。\n窗回旅梦城头角，柳结乡愁雨後蝉。\n名姓暗投心暗祝，永期收拾向门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}